<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:-2.15pt;margin-bottom:
0in;margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span style='letter-spacing:-.1pt;
layout-grid-mode:line'>            2.12.280         Public records </span>-<span
style='letter-spacing:-.1pt;layout-grid-mode:line'> no fees for inspecting </span>-<span
